# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into the Hinterlands

step Gilveradin's camp
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Ride north-east from Tarren Mill into the Hinterlands and east along the road; Gilveradin Sunchaser camps on the hill south of the elves' Quel'Danil Lodge.
  turnin 650 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Gilveradin Sunchaser
  accept 77 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Highvale
  tip The Highvale elves camp around Quel'Danil Lodge. Burn the report, the notes and the records in their camps. Rin'ji is held inside the lodge: lead him out and fight off the ambush on the way.
  interact 144073 quest 2995.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Highvale Report
  interact 144072 quest 2995.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Highvale Notes
  interact 144071 quest 2995.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Highvale Records
  accept 2742 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rin'ji
  complete 2742 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Grim Message
  when onquest 2932
  tip South of the lodge the Witherbark trolls hold their villages. Every one of them carries a skull: with twenty, use Nimboya's Pike to make the Laden Pike, then plant it inside the village.
  collect 9320 x20 "Witherbark Skull" quest 2932 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  use 15002 "Nimboya's Pike" @29.5,58.5
  use 9319 "Nimboya's Laden Pike" @29.5,58.5
  interact 142698 quest 2932.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 8684 quest 77.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  interact 142700 quest 2932.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 9320 quest 2932.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

